---
import aiRing from '../assets/ai-thinking-ring.gif';
---

<section
  id="hero"
  class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-(--color-everkind-lightgrey)"
  style="min-height: 760px;"
>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-60" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 72% 42%, rgba(221,176,74,0.16), transparent 34%), linear-gradient(135deg, #f3f3f3 0%, #ffffff 55%, #f1ede4 100%);" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid min-h-[760px] max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 px-6 pb-20 pt-32 sm:px-12 md:px-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:px-24 lg:pt-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-(--color-everkind-green)" style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">AI Native Consumer Wellness Platform</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-(--color-everkind-dark) sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">
        Building the next generation of <span class="italic text-(--color-everkind-green)">consumer wellness.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-(--color-everkind-darkgrey) sm:text-lg" style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">
        We are building a new kind of consumer company — one powered by AI that learns &amp; iterates across the entire brand lifecycle.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex max-w-3xl flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-(--color-everkind-green) sm:gap-3 sm:text-xs" style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">
        <span>Consumer Insight</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Product Innovation</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Launch</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Consumer Feedback</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Continuous Learning</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-(--color-everkind-darkgrey)/75 sm:text-base" style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">
        We believe future consumer brands may not be built by companies that are best at predicting what consumers want. It may be built by companies that are best at continuously learning what consumers want — and converting that learning into products faster than everyone else.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex min-h-[370px] items-center justify-center lg:min-h-[520px]" aria-label="Animated AI thinking agent">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full blur-3xl" style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(221,176,74,0.22), transparent 62%);"></div>
      <img src={aiRing.src} alt="Animated golden AI thinking ring" class="relative z-10 w-[min(78vw,470px)] drop-shadow-[0_24px_60px_rgba(125,92,20,0.18)]" />
      <div class="absolute z-20 flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/70 bg-white/50 text-center shadow-[0_16px_40px_rgba(87,64,20,0.14)] backdrop-blur-md sm:h-28 sm:w-28">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-[0.18em] text-(--color-everkind-green)" style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">Thinking<br />Agent</span>
      </div>
      <span class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 hidden rounded-full border border-(--color-everkind-green)/15 bg-white/70 px-4 py-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-(--color-everkind-green) backdrop-blur-sm sm:block" style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">Learns continuously</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    img { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
